  "description": {
   "en": "Otaku schoolboy Arise Riku, who is solely interested in female anime characters, is a fan of Yu-Tan from the maid cafe. However, he comes to find that Yu-Tan is actually Maejima Yuuko and sits next to him in class. He decides to give up his feelings, but...",
